<title>USA: CMS Energy files for shelf offer of notes.</title>
<headline>CMS Energy files for shelf offer of notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>CMS Energy Corp. filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on Tuesday for a shelf offering of up to $150 million of general term notes, due between 9 months and 25 years from the date of issue.</p>
<p>The company said it would use the proceeds from the sale for general corporate purposes.</p>
<p>J.W. Korth &amp; Co. will underwrite the offering.</p>
